WEBVTT

00:00:06.687 --> 00:00:11.049
Open the investor relations page. Its address is your first link

00:00:11.049 --> 00:00:14.761
If a cookie notice appears, choose No, I decline

00:00:14.761 --> 00:00:22.121
Scroll down to Latest quarterly results and select View all results

00:00:22.121 --> 00:00:27.721
The newest quarter is at the top. Note which quarter it is

00:00:27.721 --> 00:00:33.560
Right-click Earnings release and choose Copy Link Address. That is your second link

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:39.610
Now scroll down to Quick links and select Annual reports & proxies

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:45.801
The newest annual report is at the top. Note which year it covers

00:00:45.801 --> 00:00:51.692
Right-click its link and choose Copy Link Address. That is your third link
